{"t_ms": 10511359, "conversation_id": "conv_fixed_early_proxy_s2_046", "turn_id": 1, "actor": "system", "event_type": "retrieval_result", "payload": {"passages": ["Printing & Photocopy Services\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nPrinting, scanning, and photocopying services are available through the Business Centre. Guests may email their documents to the Business Centre or use the available workstations. Standard printing charges apply, while basic scanning services are provided free of charge for registered hotel guests.", "Dry Cleaning Service\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nProfessional dry cleaning services are available for delicate garments such as suits, dresses, and formal wear. Clothing collected before 10:00 AM is generally returned by the following evening. Charges vary depending on the garment type and are added to the guest's final bill.", "Housekeeping Schedule\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nDaily housekeeping services are provided between 9:00 AM and 5:00 PM. Guests who prefer not to be disturbed may activate the \"Do Not Disturb\" indicator outside their room. Additional cleaning requests or replenishment of towels and toiletries can be made by contacting housekeeping through the in-room telephone."], "scores": [0.5037457942962646, 0.813920259475708, 0.8429394960403442], "filenames": ["46_printing_services.txt", "42_dry_cleaning.txt", "15_housekeeping.txt"], "timing_policy": "fixed_early_proxy", "timing_trigger": "fixed_early_proxy", "user_end_known_at_finish": true, "launch_offset_ms_vs_user_end": -172, "overlap_with_speech_ms": 172, "forecast_invalidated": false}}
